 "text": "Osborne County Sheriff\nDepartments\nAppraiser\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Clerk\nCommissioners\nElections\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nNoxious Weeds\nOsborne Rural Fire Districts\nRecycling\nRegister Of Deeds\nSanitary Landfill\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nPartnerships\nConservation District\nDane G Hansen Foundation\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Medical Services\nOsborne County Community Foundation\nOsborne County Leadership\nNews & Information\nBio-Terrorism -->\nCalendar -->\nCounty Links\nDocuments\nE-Waste\nHistory\nJob Opportunities\nLevies\nMaps\nNews\nOpen Record Information\nText Osborne County\nVeterans Register\nAppraisal Search -->\nAppraisal Search\nOsborne County Sheriff\nScottie Becker, Sheriff\nScottie Becker, Undersheriff\n-->\n128 South 5th Street\nPO Box 235\nOsborne, KS 67473\n785-346-2001\nFax: 785-346-2345\nIn September 1871 Osborne County was formed with three special Commissioner's and a County Clerk. They held an election in November 1871 and the people elected took office in January 1872.\nOsborne County is located in north central Kansas and has an area of 900 square miles with a population of approximately 4,800 citizens.\nThe Osborne jail was built in 1955 with a holding capacity of 12.\nThe Osborne County Sheriff employs 7 full time officers. The Sheriff's department is a county wide law enforcement agency which dedicates its service to the citizens within the county.\nPersonnel:\nSheriff: Scottie Becker\nUndersheriff: Scottie Becker\n-->\nLieutenant: Michael Bristol\n-->\nDeputy: Danny Miner\n-->\nDeputy: Jerry Knouf\n-->\nDeputy: Marcus Betzold\n-->\nDeputy: Darren Stokes\n-->\nOffice Administrator: Brandy Miner\n-->\nJail Administrator: Troy Schaefer\n-->\nSheriff Pages...\nFormer Sheriffs\n|\nDispatch\n|\n&placement=left&parentOrigin=https://osbornecounty.org&mobile=0\" style=\"width: 255px; height: 276.484px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; position: fixed; right: unset; left: 0px; bottom: 60px; z-index: 10000;\">",
